[ti:Visitor song]
[ar:nishal21 and visitors]
[00:11.12]Someone stopped by late on a quiet night
[00:15.22]left a single note and went on their way
[00:21.28]I never got their name until the credits
[00:24.52]now it plays here every single day
[00:30.98]I was painting a picture (@nishal21)
[00:34.16]One note at a time
[00:38.98]from people passing through
[00:42.76]a name beside a line
[00:48.82]and part of it is you
[00:53.50]Leave yours and the song gets one beat longer
